 atrocities were committed in the name of science. If you want to survive the night, find door 208 and go through it at all costs.", "summary": "Eight people trapped in an old laboratory will try to survive their last moments of life in this frenetic body-horror full of action, blood and guts. Oxide Room 208 challenges you to face your fears in a dark and twisted environment where flesh and madness merge.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/oxide-room-208", "videos": [{"id": 103580, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "Al03LnQUjIw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Al03LnQUjIw", "title": "Oxide Room 208 | Trailer [GOG]", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Al03LnQUjIw/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 104531, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "w2k-qLUsMqY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w2k-qLUsMqY", "title": "OXIDE room 208 - actual development state", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/w2k-qLUsMqY/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 107460, "name": "Cinematic Trailer", "video_id": "fjFr4SDPNrU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fjFr4SDPNrU", "title": "S\u00f4ber - Habitaci\u00f3n 208 (V\u00eddeo oficial)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/fjFr4SDPNrU/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 135677, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "gC92c35FoD0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gC92c35FoD0", "title": "Oxide Room 208 | WORLD PREMIERE trailer at The Horror Game Awards 2024", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/gC92c35FoD0/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 150457, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "DLmLrcoyl48", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DLmLrcoyl48", "title": "Meet the victims - OXIDE ROOM 208", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/DLmLrcoyl48/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 8672, "name": "OXIDE"}]}